ers such as galadriel the initial  piece however should quickly turn around  to the opposite because there's also  mention of the long feared return of  evil which should refer to none other  than sauron a special treat for the eyes  will also be the vast landscape of  middle earth which stretches from the  darkest depth of the misty mountains to  the majestic forests of linden and the  breathtaking island kingdom of numenor  as amazon itself announced however some  questions are still left unanswered for  instance it is not clear whether the  current cannon will be kept or discarded  all this is to be found out later this  summer because the lord of the rings the  rings of power will air on september 2nd  2022 exclusively on amazon prime  before the end of the year we will be  able to enjoy the new dc sequel aquaman  and the lost kingdom in theaters on  instagram director james juan now shared  a sheery picture from the last day of  shooting where he can be seen alongside  patrick wilson and jason momoa on the  beach in malibu the dc executives must  have high hopes for the new equipment  because if you look at the past films  like birds of prey of the suicide squad  they have either produced flops in the  recent past or thrilled to mess with  movies like joker in between there was  basically nothing and to be honest joker  is not really part of the dceu and  completely stands on its own aquaman  from 2018 on the other hand is the most  successful dc film of all time with box  office takings of 1.1 billion us dollars  which of course has also to do with the  extremely popular jason momoa in  addition to the obligatory words of  thanks to the cast and crew in the  instagram post one also emphasized that  the movie still has a long way to go  before it's truly ready for the big  screen in terms of content aquaman and  the lost kingdom once again revolves  around the titular superhero arthur  curry who is the new king of atlantis  following the defeat of his half-brother  or marius pretty soon it becomes clear  that the two feuding characters will  have to team up after all as a long  hidden force is threatening atlantis and  in fact the entire world in addition to  momoa and wilson we will be able to see  among others dolph lundgren as king  nurius nicole kidman as queen atlanta  yaya abdulmuddin ii has black manta and  last but not least amber her desmara who  is widely scorned in the fan community  the screenplay is once again written by  david leslie johnson mcgoldrick while  production is also directed by peter  safran alongside james wong aquaman and  the lost kingdom will hit theaters on  december 16th 2022  we can look forward to the new black  panther wakanda forever at the end of  this year and it seems that an actress  who was thought to be out of action is  now returning to the set we are of  course talking about leticia wright who  as we reported last year injured herself  so severely during filming that she was  unable to perform for months a return  was not foreseeable until now also  because she made statements about the  covert vaccination which gave the  responsible people at disney headaches  now the 28 year old british actress has  fought her way back which should  especially please those involved in the  production after all shooting was  completely on hold for the time being  because of her important role as shuri  in particular the fact that shuri is the  sister of king t'challa who as everyone  knows was embodied by chadwick boseman  who passed away in 2020 may have finally  prompted the responsible parties to let  her return in fact there's a persistent  theory that shuri has to follow in the  footsteps of her brother t'challa and  that she will therefore play a very  important almost irreplaceable role in  black panther wakanda forever whether  right and her character shuri will  continue to play a role in the mcu after  the black panther sequel is unlikely as  disney and especially the mcu are not  known for tolerating divergent and  controversial opinions in the ranks for  now however filming continues in atlanta  and we're definitely excited to see  latisha right back for roll black  panther wakanda forever will be released  in theaters on november 11 2022  this year not only the batman will be  released in theaters its female  counterpart batgirl will also soon  celebrate her premiere in the form of a  new movie the movie will be directed by  bad boys for life directors ariel arby  and bilal fala who will release the dc  blockbuster on hbo max despite the  extremely prominent cast which in  addition to leading actress leslie  grace's batgirl also features stars like  jk simmons as her father james gordon  brandon fraser as the villain firefly  and michael keaton as batman it appears  that a theatrical release is still  unlikely filming is currently taking  place in glasgow scotland where we were  finally treated to a first image of  batgirl a few days ago the outfit  appears not to be very close to the  original comic but that should  definitely not them in our anticipation  for the film there's currently no  concrete release date for batgirl  although we can probably expect a  release on hbo max this year  just about everyone knows the frozen  song let it go which was magnificently  sung by u.s star idina mensle and surely  played in millions of children's rooms  one could almost think that this is the  most successful disney song of all time  but we were taught otherwise this week  as revealed by the u's billboard charge  the title song of ancanto called we  don't talk about bruno is now the most  successful disney song in over 26 years  the first spot on the us charge  certainly does justice to this planet  animated film as it was able to convince  critics and disney fans alike in spite  of the circumstances which were not  always simple due to the pandemic the  tick tock platform probably played a  significant part in the success as the  hashtag encanto really took off there  with billions of views if you have a  disney plus subscription and haven't  seen the film yet you should do so  quickly and not just because of the  highly popular theme song  slowly but surely the production of the  last of our series is progressing as  those responsibly confirmed storm reed  who is only 18 years old is now part of  the cast it is furthermore known that  she will embody the role of ellie's  friend riley abel which surprised many  fans while riley is not a part of the  two main games she does appear in a dlc  of the first part called left behind  where the young girls heartwarming but  ultimately tragic story is told the dlc  is set a few weeks before the events of  the first part and takes place in an  abandoned mall in boston where the two  best friends perfectly combine emotional  conversations with funny actions in a  video that circulated on twitter back on  january 10th a scene strongly  reminiscent of that very mall was seen  in the background a few days ago an  appearance by riley was then officially  confirmed it is therefore quite possible  that the content of the upcoming series  will start off with left behind or  alternatively that the story of the dlc  will be used for various flashbacks  however this series is supposed to  revolve around the story of the first  part and the two main characters joel  and ellie who have to fight their way  west through the united states in order  to reach a research facility in addition  to pedro pascals joel and balaram say as  ellie the cast also includes gabriel  luna as joe's brother tommy anna dwarf  as tess and con o'neal as bill it is not  known yet when exactly the series by  chernobyl traitor craig mazin and neil  druckmann will be out but we will of  course keep you up to  date so that's it with our news for this  week of course do not miss to have a  look at the aforementioned teaser for  the lord of the rings series on our  channel in addition there's a new moon  knight 